<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SEEYUH - Terms of Service</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #282b30;
            color: #dcddde;
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        h1, h2 {
            color: #7289da;
        }
        a {
            color: #5865F2;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .nav img {
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        .nav a {
            margin-right: 15px;
            color: #5865F2;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
        }
        
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(31, 31, 31, 0.5);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="nav">
        <a href="/"><img src="/assets/avatar.png" alt="Avatar"></a>
        <a href="/policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
    </div>
    
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: 9th November 2024</p>

    <p>Welcome to {{ bot_name }}! By using this bot, you agree to the following terms and conditions:</p>

    <h2>1. Usage</h2>
    <p>{{ bot_name }} is intended for entertainment and utility purposes on Discord. By using this bot, you agree to use it responsibly and in compliance with all Discord community guidelines.</p>

    <h2>2. Prohibited Actions</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Do not use {{ bot_name }} to spam or harass other users.</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to exploit or misuse the bot's features in any way.</li>
        <li>Do not use the bot to share or promote inappropriate or illegal content.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>We make no guarantees regarding the functionality or availability of {{ bot_name }}. The bot is provided "as-is" without warranties of any kind. We are not responsible for any issues arising from its use.</p>

    <h2>4. Changes to the Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. The most recent version will always be available here. By continuing to use {{ bot_name }}, you agree to any changes made to these terms.</p>

    <h2>5. Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions or concerns about these Terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>.</p>
</body>
</html>